  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: India's private hospitals should not be viewed on the price of individual drugs, injections or consumables without accounting for the wider <a href=\"/tag/clinical+value+chain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clinical value chain</a> involved in delivering care, <a href=\"/tag/max+healthcare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Max Healthcare</a> chairman and managing director Abhay Soi said, amid growing scrutiny over <a href=\"/tag/hospital+pricing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hospital pricing</a>.Soi's comments come against the backdrop of Maharashtra scrutinising steep markups on hospital consumables and the Supreme Court's recent observation on a cancer drug carrying a markup of 10 times with patients required to procure it through in-hospital pharmacies.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>\"By the end of the day, a hospital is not selling an IV fluid bag. A hospital is not selling an injection,\" Soi said. \"A hospital is administering the injection.\"</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>\"There is a particular training, there is a particular sort of storage requirement, then administering the medicine and then disposal through proper biomedical waste processes. There is an entire value chain,\" he said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Hospitals have thousands of individual billing items, with margins varying across products and services, Soi said. \"Some won't have margin, some will have margin. But ultimately it translates to that 8-9% net profit,\" Soi said.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Rica Bhattacharyya</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Rica Bhattacharyya</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675387/ET-Bureau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ET Bureau</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 6, 2026 at 07:29 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 6, 2026 at 07:29 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n          